---
import DocsLayout from '~/layouts/DocsLayout.astro'
---

<DocsLayout slug="clients/rust" title="Rust engine" description="cargo add kotoshu — the engine itself as a crate: Dictionary load, correct, ranked suggest, the C ABI batch format, and the models registry behind the resources feature.">
  <p class="docs-lead">
    The <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">kotoshu</code> crate is the engine every
    other surface wraps — pure Rust, no runtime dependencies by default.
  </p>

  <h2 class="display text-2xl mt-12">Install</h2>
  <pre class="code-block overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-7 mt-4"><code>cargo add kotoshu</code></pre>

  <h2 class="display text-2xl mt-12">Quick start</h2>
  <pre class="code-block overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-7 mt-4" is:raw><code>use std::path::Path;

fn main() {
    let dict = kotoshu::dict::Dictionary::load(
        Path::new("en_US.aff"),
        Path::new("en_US.dic"),
    )
    .expect("load dictionary");

    println!("correct(\"hello\") = {}", dict.correct("hello"));
    println!("correct(\"helo\")  = {}", dict.correct("helo"));

    for s in dict.suggest("hlelo", 3) {
        println!(
            "suggest: {} dist={} conf={:.2} source={:?}",
            s.word, s.distance, s.confidence, s.source
        );
    }
}</code></pre>
  <pre class="code-block overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-7 mt-4" is:raw><code>correct("hello") = true
correct("helo")  = false
suggest: hello dist=1 conf=1.00 source=EditDistance
suggest: halo dist=1 conf=0.50 source=Phonetic
suggest: heel dist=1 conf=0.50 source=Phonetic</code></pre>
  <p class="text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--color-text-2)] mt-4">
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Dictionary::load</code> takes paths;
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">load_from_sources</code> takes the
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">.aff</code>/<code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">.dic</code>
    text directly — byte-symmetric, and the form the wasm binding uses. A
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Suggestion</code> carries
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">word</code>,
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">distance</code>,
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">confidence</code>, and a
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">SuggestionSource</code> enum
    (<code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">EditDistance</code>,
    <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Phonetic</code>, keyboard, n-gram) — the same row
    the conformance vectors freeze.
  </p>

  <h2 class="display text-2xl mt-12">Features</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto mt-4"><table class="w-full text-sm">
    <thead>
      <tr class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-3)]">
        <th class="px-3 py-2.5 text-left">Feature</th>
        <th class="px-3 py-2.5 text-left">Adds</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)]">
        <td class="px-3 py-2.5"><code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">(default)</code></td>
        <td class="px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-text-2)]">dictionaries, affixes, ranked suggestions — zero dependencies</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)]">
        <td class="px-3 py-2.5"><code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">rerank</code></td>
        <td class="px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-text-2)]">context-aware reranking math — cosine similarity over host-supplied vectors; always compiled, this is the module</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)]">
        <td class="px-3 py-2.5"><code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">onnx</code></td>
        <td class="px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-text-2)]">the <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[var(--color-accent)]">OrtProvider</code> over ONNX Runtime — dynamic loading only, never bundled</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)]">
